Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventh Episode\NThe Swan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, chamberlain! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, great keeper of time!\NHow's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so nervous, Garigori?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my only daughter Mary\Nhas disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do? Poor me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mary has disappeared?!\N- She's nowhere to be found! Poor Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We evil spirits\Nwish Hecate...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...a very happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:04:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you,\Nhappy birthday to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,happy birthday to Hecate,\Nhappy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Many thanks, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you have presents for her?\N- Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A face lotion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,made with the blood\Nof snake and lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord!\NIf your daughter Hecate...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...rubs her face\Nwith it every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,she will become meaner\Nand prettier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,An elixir of vulture tears...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the horn of a goat\Nblind in one eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is this yours?\N- Yes! One drop in her eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...will give her sight\Nso sharp...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...who will read\Nthe minds of men!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots!\NTake back your trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For my daughter\NI only want one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.06,0:05:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,a heart that will make her become\Na good... witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire's blue one?\N- Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire,\Neven though she is a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,also has the heart of a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When I take that heart away from her and\Ntransplant it into Hecate's chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make my daughter\Na great witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You, swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this be the animal\Nthat will bring me Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Earth, cursed swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, tell me: have you found Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no trace, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go back to scour the kingdom\Nin search of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear a strange sound...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a swan! It seems injured
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid,\NI don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori! Catch that swan\Nthat fell behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! How do you expect me\Nto start thinking about a swan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...with all the worries\Nthat I have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid its wound will\Nget worse if it keeps flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid, I'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! I'll nurse you back to\Nhealth, beautiful little swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought\Nsomeone was calling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm here!\N- Ah, it's you, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to that swan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's injured\Nand I caught it to treat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Sapphire, let go of\Nthat swan! Leave it alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- And why is that?\N- Because it is not a normal swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel that that animal\Ncomes from the devil's court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- The devil?!\N- Yes, but I will break the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...with my angel feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you are\Nnot a normal swan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it is trying to\Ntell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems it wants to ask for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It says it is a girl kidnapped by\NMephisto and transformed into a swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I know who you are! You\Nare Mary, Garigori's daughter, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is a surprise! That is\Nwhy Mary is nowhere to be found!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We should inform Garigori of\Nwhat happened to his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mary! Mary! My poor\Ndaughter! Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Garigori, we have\Nfound your daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really? And where is she?\N- Right before your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She was transformed\Ninto a swan by Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter! Dear Mary,\Nwhat happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor daughter! What\Nhave they done to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the\Nconsolation of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor, little dear! Mary! Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you hear?\N- Opal, little horse, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- No!\N- Leave me alone! I will teach Mephisto a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you understand?!\NThis is one of his traps!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mary, speak, my little\Ngirl! Tell me something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal! Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Opal...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal! Go, Opal! To the\Nfield of the black lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, Opal!\NWhere are you going? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going in the wrong\Ndirection! You have to go the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But where could he be taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sapphire, I\Nwas forced to tie you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't want you to go.\N- How dare you stand in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You will stay in this little church\Nuntil I have driven out Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are safe, because\Nthe devil will be afraid to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do such a thing! You\Nwon't be able to defeat Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes I can! You forget that\NI have an angel's feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me come with you, Tink!\N- No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- My poor daughter is dead!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Her body is already cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My feather will restore her to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's useless!\N- Why didn't it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto has taken Mary back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He has imprisoned her\Nsoul in a magic sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To get her back, that sphere must\Nbe exposed to the morning light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie me and I will get that\Nsphere! Damn it, he's already gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, Tink! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?\NHelp! The roof is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where did His Highness go?\N- Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it's Sapphire...!\NStop, Sapphire! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto is doing this on purpose to\Nmake you fall into a trap! You mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way or you'll be trampled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.46,0:11:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that the Prince of\NSilverland is not afraid of any devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And now excuse me,\Nbut I'll take your feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing a foolish thing! What\Nwill happen if Mephisto captures you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland will fall into the\Nhands of the evil bandits...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...should you be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well!\NMy plan is succeeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you happy, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is falling into my net!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to\Nbe happy. I don't feel well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can take a little\Npoison, or... Oh, I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The devils! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at them there! They are\Nall drunk! Now I'll handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire wants to fight Mephisto\Nalone, but he won't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The devil is far\Nstronger than him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I must try to free\Nmyself so I can help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to deal with me, Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My little Hecate, do you know that\Nyou are about to become a great witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry, I\Nwill always be close to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see, I will make you happy!\NFor you I would do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I would even fight\Nagainst Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you did that, the Lord would\Nturn you to ashes as punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't care about\Nbeing turned to ashes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...for my dear, little Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So hot...! That crater is\Nthe entrance to Mephisto's lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better\Nnow that you've had fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! It had been a long\Ntime since I had this much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail, Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll like\Nit! Open the box!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's there...!\NOh, what a beautiful cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you,\Nhappy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy! So, let's hear:\Nhow old are you today, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 13, Dad!\N- Devils, I need 13 candles!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, blow out the\Ncandles, daughter! Blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Why don't you put\Nout the fire with your magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The hellfire is too strong\Nfor this little breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat the fire of the candles\Nfor me, fire-eating bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not there yet! Give it your all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I want rain! Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems a bit too little to\Nput out a fire, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Downpour!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's too much! The\Nbirthday cake will melt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor me,\NI can't do anything right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on,\Ndaughter! It's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I know anyway that\Neverything I do is done badly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be discouraged,\Ndaughter, but keep trying...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.94,0:16:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...until things\Ngo well for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehi, Mephisto!\NI smell a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?\NYeah, seems like it to me too
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This means that Sapphire\Nhas finally arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.14,0:16:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trapped now, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stay as I am, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to\Ngive me Sapphire's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, Dad!\N- Don't be foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lie down here for the operation!\N- No, Dad! I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's between us,\NPrince! You won't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is he? He was\Njust here! I know he was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an angel's feather!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm taking the magic sphere!\N- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want it, Mephisto!\N- You'll have to fight for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she stays here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, Hecate! Damn Sapphire,\Nwhat do you intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.14,0:18:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hurt her, I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send your daughter up there\Nonly if you give me the magic sphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- How dare you?\N- Look, I have the feather!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- You'd better make a deal!\N- Damn that feather!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll accept the exchange! But\Naren't you ashamed of blackmailing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you babbling about, Mephisto?\NYou should be ashamed, rather,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for having transformed\Nsweet Mary into a swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, you won this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn the feather!\NTake the magic sphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster, friends! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn this tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Picchio, can you give me a hand?\N- I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, you were very kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it, it was a pleasure!\NAnd besides, I'm crazy about the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't calling you, but some\Nbird to get a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? That I'm not\Nstrong enough to give you a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, even though I'm small,\NI think I weigh enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No nonsense! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! I didn't think\Nyou were so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The feather! Whirlwind,\Nblow that feather away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Sapphire\Nwill no longer be able to resist me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.14,0:20:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hide among you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where have you hidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me! I see that there\Nis one swan too many among you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, I know you have\Ntransformed into a swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back to normal\Nand don't make me angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dad! I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be foolish and remember\Nthat you are the daughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you cared about\Nmaking me happy, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let go of me, dad!\NI don't want to! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Is dawn already breaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! How time has flown\Ntonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.78,0:21:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit hoarse,\NI can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The rooster's crow,\Nyou can do it even better!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, now I'll try to do it\Na bit better! Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I did it!\N- Still, it doesn't convince me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still stars in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This rooster suffers from insomnia!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned beast, it's still night!\NCut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the dev...! It's an angel! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel on me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him off me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel has latched onto me!\NI can't shake him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, give him that sphere right now!\NHurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.22,0:22:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you, poisonous angel!\NJust go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.58,0:22:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire! - He almost drowned\Nto get the magic sphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.74,0:22:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wake up!\NSapphire, it's me: Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.82,0:22:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- And what are you doing here?\N- Help me! I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- The sphere is at the bottom of the lake!\N- I'm going to get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We must expose it\Nto the rising morning sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,thus the swan's spell\Nwill be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the sun is about to rise!\NRight in that direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a miracle!\NBut it's Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- My little girl! Mary!\N- Dear Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- My daughter!\N- Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.50,0:23:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Tink:\Nthere is another swan flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.26,0:23:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see it, but... That is\NHecate, the daughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.02,0:24:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why she is accompanying us...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.06,0:24:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she would gladly make\Nfriends with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.78,0:24:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,if she could forget\Nwhose daughter she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.62,0:24:38.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.24,0:24:41.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.24,0:24:41.60,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
